gbm-msm-backend (1.2.11-0qli1) forky; urgency=medium

  [ Abhijith Desai ]
  * New upstream release
    - Relicense from BSD-3-Clause-Clear to BSD-3-Clause.
    - Install msm-kms_gbm.so compatibility symlink pointing to msm_gbm.so.
    - Install the backend into the gbmbackendspath provided by gbm.pc and
      the default_fmt_alignment.xml config under sysconfdir/gbm.
    - Install the gbm_msm.h header.
  * d/copyright: update license to BSD-3-Clause, matching upstream.
  * d/libgbm-msm1.install: install the backend library and the
    default_fmt_alignment.xml config from debian/tmp, where the upstream Meson
    rules put them.
  * Add libgbm-msm-dev package shipping the gbm_msm.h header installed by the
    upstream Meson rules.
  * d/libgbm-msm1.install: use a wildcard instead of DEB_HOST_MULTIARCH

  [ Agathe Porte ]
  * libgbm-msm-dev: add dep on libgbm-dev for gbm_backend_abi.h
  * patch: bump meson_version to fix build warnings
  * patch: use meson warning level and werror

